<title>USA: West Noble HSBC, Ind., won by City Securities.</title>
<headline>West Noble HSBC, Ind., won by City Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>City Securities Corp. said it won $1.620 million of West Noble HSBC, Ind., first mortgage bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.8984 percent.</p>
